{
  "contract_version": "mis-g7-s2-s5b/1",
  "notes": [
    "All RPCs return jsonb. Domain refusals are HTTP-200 {ok:false, code,...} with NOTHING written; raised errors (SQLSTATE 42501 permission/MIS_G7_AUTH_REQUIRED, P0001 MIS_G7_DEPLETION_MISMATCH / MIS_G7_CORRECTION_MISMATCH / MIS_G7_NEGATIVE_BALANCE, 22003 MIS_G7_SOURCE_ID_OVERFLOW, 40P01/40001 retry up to 3x) roll the whole transaction back.",
    "Actor is always auth.uid(); no client 'authorized'/'committed' flag is read. Generate one UUID per user intent (request/idempotency key); replay returns the stored result with idempotent_replay:true.",
    "Historical rows without a signed stage are NOT_VERIFIED: refusals carry historical_state:'NOT_VERIFIED'. Location is never a gate.",
    "UI: no hard-coded theme palette is implied by this contract; the excess modal is shown only after INSUFFICIENT_BULK with excess_permitted:true."
  ],
  "rpcs": [
    {
      "name": "mis_sign_batch_stage_v1",
      "args": [
        [
          "p_idempotency_key",
          "uuid"
        ],
        [
          "p_product_id",
          "integer"
        ],
        [
          "p_batch_number",
          "text"
        ],
        [
          "p_work_log_id",
          "integer"
        ],
        [
          "p_route_step_id",
          "bigint"
        ],
        [
          "p_step_occurrence",
          "integer"
        ],
        [
          "p_measured_qty_base",
          "numeric"
        ],
        [
          "p_evidence_ref",
          "text"
        ]
      ],
      "permission": "module:mis-batch-stage-signer (edit)",
      "ok_keys": [
        "ok",
        "idempotent_replay",
        "event_id",
        "stage_role",
        "route_id",
        "bmr_id",
        "source_fingerprint"
      ],
